who had discovered what he was doing.

104
00:11:29,772 --> 00:11:34,735
A mutant with the ability to
transform herself into anyone.

105
00:11:35,236 --> 00:11:36,653
Mystique.

106
00:11:37,530 --> 00:11:39,615
PROFESSOR X:
I knew her as Raven.

107
00:11:39,824 --> 00:11:41,241
We met when
we were children,

108
00:11:41,326 --> 00:11:43,160
grew up together.

109
00:11:44,037 --> 00:11:45,829
She was like
a sister to me.

110
00:11:46,164 --> 00:11:47,873
I tried to help her...

111
00:11:48,041 --> 00:11:51,585
but only succeeded
in driving her away.

112
00:11:52,295 --> 00:11:55,172
She hunted Trask
across the world.

113
00:11:55,506 --> 00:11:58,800
And at the Paris
Peace Accords in 1973,

114
00:11:58,885 --> 00:12:00,135
after the Vietnam War...

115
00:12:00,970 --> 00:12:02,346
