time she killed.

118
00:12:14,984 --> 00:12:16,568
It wasn't her last.

119
00:12:16,736 --> 00:12:20,489
But killing Trask did not
have the outcome she expected.

120
00:12:20,615 --> 00:12:22,407
It only persuaded
the government

121
